{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "device-management-api-collection",
    "name": "Device Management API",
    "description": "API untuk mengelola perangkat (device) dengan sistem kepemilikan dan PIN password.\n\n## Flow Penggunaan\n1. User Register/Login\n2. User cek status device → GET /api/device/status/:deviceCode\n3. Jika device belum terdaftar → POST /api/device/register (dengan PIN baru)\n4. Untuk koneksi berikutnya → POST /api/device/connect (dengan PIN)\n5. Untuk melepas device → POST /api/device/forget (dengan PIN)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "accessToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "deviceCode",
      "value": "DEVICE-001",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "pin",
      "value": "1234",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
